<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Warmstone resource systems (mechanics only).

  RESOURCE_WARMSTONE_CANOPY_SAP : Bonus resource on FEATURE_WARMSTONE_CANOPY, standing
    in for the canopy/ground-layer carbon economy (see homeworld_brief.md, "Warmstone's
    Biosphere"). Improved by the existing IMPROVEMENT_PLANTATION - no new improvement
    needed, same pattern vanilla uses for Cocoa/Coffee/etc. on Jungle.

  RESOURCE_WARMSTONE_VENT_GAS : Strategic resource on FEATURE_WARMSTONE_VENT_MARSH,
    standing in for the Wilder sulfide-wetland's geothermal/sulfide chemistry. Needs
    its own extraction improvement (IMPROVEMENT_WARMSTONE_VENT_TAP), modeled directly
    on vanilla's IMPROVEMENT_OIL_WELL (same EnforceTerrain/MustRemoveFeature pattern),
    reusing the Oil Well's existing icon rather than shipping new art.

  Name attributes are literal internal Type IDs, not authored copy, per the AI content
  boundary - see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
-->
<GameInfo>
	<Types>
